  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for tomcat11",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for tomcat11 fixes the following issues\n\n- Update to Tomcat 11.0.24\n- CVE-2026-59083: Incorrect URL decoding in RewriteValve may allow security control bypass (bsc#1271397).\n- CVE-2026-59084: EncryptInterceptor requirements not clearly documented (bsc#1271398).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
